  "releaseNotes": "0.1.1: fixed truncated multi-page directory enumeration (and '.'/'..' are no longer returned), short-read truncation in ReadAllBytesAsync, READ/WRITE frames that exceeded the direct-TCP frame limit, stale responses after cancellation, unsafe concurrent use of one client connection, raw ChannelClosedException on transport loss, OperationCanceledException on connect timeout, and stale or inconsistent server file timestamps; added OpenCifsClientTransportException, ranged ReadAsync, streaming OpenReadAsync and WriteAsync(Stream), Metadata.ExistsAsync, recursive Directories.CreateAsync, share-root paths, and directory-entry IsDirectory plus UTC timestamps. See https://github.com/jchristn/OpenCIFS/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md.",
